# Mostaql apply loop

When the user asks to find/apply on Mostaql (مستقل) or runs the apply loop:

1. Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)
2. Read [`.agents/skills/candidate-source.md`](../../.agents/skills/candidate-source.md) and the current `resume.tex`
3. Load and follow [`.agents/skills/freelance-apply-loop/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/freelance-apply-loop/SKILL.md) with platform Mostaql
4. Never submit without explicit OK for that project
5. Candidate facts only from the current master `.tex`; proposals default to Arabic
